<html>
<head>
    <title>Anshu Devkota - Portfolio</title>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Anshu Devkota</h1>
        <h2>Grade 11 Student & Creative Designer</h2>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- SECTION 1: Text Formatting & Headings -->
        <section>
            <h3>About Me</h3>
            <h4>Academic Background</h4>
            <h5>Creative Hobbies</h5>
            <h6>Future Aspirations</h6>

            <p>
                Hello! My name is <strong>Anshu Devkota</strong>. I am currently a Grade 11 student studying at <em>St. Xavier's College</em> in Maitighar. 
                I have a strong passion for <b>creative arts</b> and <i>digital creation</i>, with a growing interest in <mark>Web Designing</mark>.
            </p>

            <p>
                When I am not studying, you can find me expressing my creativity through traditional and digital mediums. 
                My main hobbies include <strong>painting</strong>, <strong>drawing</strong>, and <strong>sketching</strong>. I also enjoy musical expression and spend time learning to play the <em>piano</em>.
            </p>


        </section>

        
        <section>
            <h3>Profile Picture</h3>
            <img src="IMG_2089.jpeg" alt="Anshu Devkota Profile Image" width="300" height="300">
        </section>

    
        <section>
            <h3>Audio Sample (Piano Practice)</h3>
            <audio controls>
                <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/horse.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
            </audio>
        </section>

    
        <section>
            <h3>Video Showcase</h3>
            <video controls poster="https://via.placeholder.com/500x300" width="500">
                <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.ogg" type="audio/ogg">
                Your browser does not support the video element.
            </video>
        </section>

        <!-- SECTION 5: Advanced Embeds -->
        <section>
            <h3>External Embeds & Documents</h3>

            <!-- <object> example for PDF/External Document -->
            <h4>Embedded Portfolio Document (Object Tag)</h4>
            <object data="https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf" type="application/pdf" width="100%" height="400">
                <p>Your browser does not support PDF embedding.</p>
            </object>

            <!-- <embed> example for Media/Graphics -->
            <h4>Embedded Media (Embed Tag)</h4>
            <embed src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" width="400" height="250">

            <!-- <iframe> example for External Webpages -->
            <h4>Embedded Web Reference (Iframe Tag)</h4>
            <iframe src="https://www.wikipedia.org" width="100%" height="300"></iframe>
        </section>
    </main>

</body>
</html>